  data: {
    LLM: "As declarer, lead with your strong combinations to shed cards quickly. As the secret partner, help the declarer without revealing yourself too early — play high cards to support their leads.\n\nPartner revelation timing: revealing early doubles the score but makes you a target. Reveal late only if winning is certain. As an opponent, watch for suspicious play that suggests someone is helping the declarer.\n\nBomb management: holding a bomb gives you enormous power to interrupt opponents' leads. Save bombs for critical moments when opponents are about to go out. Social deduction: track which players pass on beatable combinations — they may be secretly helping the declarer.",
    Player: "As declarer, lead with your strong combinations to shed cards quickly. As the secret partner, help the declarer without revealing yourself too early — play high cards to support their leads.\n\nPartner revelation timing: revealing early doubles the score but makes you a target. Reveal late only if winning is certain. As an opponent, watch for suspicious play that suggests someone is helping the declarer.\n\nBomb management: holding a bomb gives you enormous power to interrupt opponents' leads. Save bombs for critical moments when opponents are about to go out. Social deduction: track which players pass on beatable combinations — they may be secretly helping the declarer.",
